  "method": "Read issue-399 scope and original-packet snapshot from immutable scope_snapshot.commit; read geographic/release source files only with git show from immutable baseline.commit. Enumerate every committed data/geography/part-N.json in that baseline and require exactly one actual occurrence of each subject ID; bind the containing file to its ordinary file hash. Verify whole-file source descriptors, v5 hierarchy/footprint/macro-certificate pins, frozen region hashes, member-ID digest, projection and complete source hierarchy before constructing or writing output. No mutable working-tree geography files are inputs. This correction records original v5 inputs only; it makes no new current-main geography refresh.",
